From: MridaOS Dev <darpan@mridaos.dev>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 10:43:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: security hardening + offline conflict resolution + IRN
 portal redirect

- Remove hardcoded Supabase credentials from all 4 scripts (use process.env)
- Remove hardcoded old project URL from api.ts
- Move Gemini API call from browser to server-side edge function (gemini-vision)
- Add offline conflict resolution: FIFO queue, stock check before sync, owner alert on conflict
- Add NIC e-Invoice portal redirect: downloads IRP v1.1 compliant JSON + opens portal
- Rename IRN label to Internal Invoice Reference Hash (honest labeling)
- AppContext: surface sync conflicts as operational alerts for owner dashboard
